5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I worry about relying on conditions we cannot control, like weather or transport.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,The location of our branches already dictates who can reach us.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,Why do we keep judging new ideas by how they sound?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Budgets often look fine on day one but thin out by year two.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,We need to check if staff actually have the skills for new tasks.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Benjamin, that sounds like a recurring pattern in our planning.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Rin, perhaps we should look at past records before deciding.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"I just want to see what actually happened before, not just talk.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I agree. The shape of the funding matters more than the size.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,I will look into the volunteer register to see who is available.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I want to check the winter road closures to see how reliable access is.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will look into the bus links in the outer wards.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,I am curious about the two programmes begun six years ago.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I need to see the county grant terms and the endowment.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will also check the volunteer register and supervision training.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,It is important to know if the roads are safe for service.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,Understanding the transport gaps is key to our reach.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Rin,,I hope the records show us something useful.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Let us see if the funding structure holds up.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Minako,,We must ensure we are not overcommitting our current staff.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
