35,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"The roads were closed eleven days, but the halls kept their timetables.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Two outer wards lost their bus link, making access an hour away.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,The old digitisation project left half the images unindexed.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The grant only covers fees for twelve months, then it's on us.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minako,,"We have retired tradespeople, but no one trained to supervise facilitators.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Jonathan, that bus loss is a serious barrier for those residents.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shizue, yes, it reshuffles who can actually reach a staffed counter.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Benjamin, so the funding disappears after a year? That is risky.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Rin, exactly. The capital items draw on the endowment, which is limited.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Rin, the unindexed images suggest a lack of follow-through in the past.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shizue,,The attendance at former outreach stops was higher than midweek main branch.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"Evening room bookings are full, but remote catalogue use peaks later.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Rin,,"The partner-run evening groups still meet unaided, which is interesting.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,The scanning contractors slip their delivery windows for larger clients.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minako,,The technician who kept tools certified retired in spring.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shizue,,High attendance at stops suggests a real need for mobile services.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,The mismatch between room bookings and remote use is notable.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Rin,,It seems some things work well without our direct supervision.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,The delivery delays make the digital archive timeline uncertain.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minako,,"Without certified tool supervision, the maker workshop is difficult.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
