60,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"Given the road closures and high stop attendance, the Mobile Branch seems viable.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,The bus link loss makes the Mobile Branch essential for outer wards.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
