63,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,The Mobile Branch avoids the long-term funding trap of the grant.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Minako,,"The Mobile Branch uses existing staff skills, unlike the workshop.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Shizue,,I am leaning towards the Mobile Branch for its reliability.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. It addresses the access gap directly.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Rin,,I support the Mobile Branch. It has proven records.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,The Mobile Branch is the most financially sustainable option.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
