75,3,4,talk,Shizue,,I think we are all aligned on the Mobile Branch.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Jonathan,,"Yes, the data supports it strongly.","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Rin,,Let us vote for the Mobile Branch.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
